[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0662","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0662.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0204","title":"WatchGuard Firebox II PPTP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WatchGuard Firebox II 4.5 版本的 PPTP 协议实现存在拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程向目标设备建立多个 PPTP 连接，并发送格式异常的 PPTP 数据包。由于系统在处理这些恶意构造的数据包时未能正确校验其格式，导致服务进程异常终止或系统资源耗尽，从而引发拒绝服务，使合法用户无法正常使用 PPTP 隧道服务。该漏洞影响运行受影响版本固件的 WatchGuard Firebox II 设备，攻击条件宽松，仅需网络可达即可实施攻击，无需任何凭证或交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0204"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 WatchGuard Firebox II 固件至 Fireware 4.6 或更高版本，以修复 PPTP 数据包处理中的拒绝服务漏洞。如暂无法升级，应在防火墙上临时禁用 PPTP 服务（VPN），并限制外部 PPTP 端口（TCP 1723）的访问，仅允许受信任的 IP 地址通过防火墙规则进行访问控制，同时持续监控系统日志中是否存在异常 PPTP 连接请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/162965","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2369","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6109","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0204.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0204.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0204","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0204.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0204.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-02xx/CVE-2001-0204.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/dd39090b66ba37823c9d39b1b14ea39a58874d96/2001/CVE-2001-0204.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/d04c47fa1c5351dcfc0e5326362cbbabb6ce30da/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0204.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a3