45562cf85cc26422f7cd/2001/CVE-2001-0164.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0164.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0164.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0164.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0647.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0643","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0643.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0157","title":"Palm Palm OS 安全绕过漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0157是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0157"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:46Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Palm OS 升级至 3.5.3 或更高版本（推荐升级至 Palm OS 4.0 或 5.x），该版本已修复调试后门模式的安全绕过漏洞。若设备无法升级系统，可采取物理安全措施：启用设备密码锁定、禁止非授权人员接触设备、在企业环境部署设备管理策略限制调试接口访问。Palm OS 3.5.3 发布于 2001 年 6 月，可通过 Palm Desktop 软件或厂商官网获取对应设备的 ROM 更新包进行刷机升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a030101-1.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6196","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0157.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0157.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0157","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0157.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0157.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0157.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/49d534031f059b5baeabd1b01333339621c7c95a/2001/CVE-2001-0157.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0157.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0157.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0157.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0643.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0642","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0642.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0156","title":"VanDyke VShell SSH 网关未授权端口转发漏洞","description":"VShell SSH gateway 1.0.1 及更早版本存在缺省端口转发规则配置漏洞。该软件默认配置了允许任意源地址到任意目标地址的端口转发规则（0.0.0.0/0.0.0.0），攻击条件要求攻击者已作为本地用户登录系统，无需额外身份认证即可利用该配置向网络中的其他系统发起任意端口转发。通过该漏洞，已获得本地访问权限的攻击者可以将受感染的 SSH 网关作为跳板，绕过网络边界防护访问内部系统或其他受保护的服务，造成信息泄露或横向移动风险。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0156"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:46Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 VShell 到 2.0 或更高版本（当前最新为 5.0），新版本默认限制了端口转发规则。若暂时无法升级，请在 VShell 控制面板的「端口转发」设置中，将默认的 0.0.0.0/0.0.0.0 规则删除或修改为仅允许特定目标 IP 和端口（如仅允许内网管理段 192.168.1.0/24 访问 22/3389 端口），并重启 VShell 服务使配置生效。若业务不需要 SSH 端口转发功能，可直接在控制面板禁用「允许端口转发」选项彻底规避风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a021601-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2402","http://www.vandyke.com/products/vshell/security102.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6148","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0156.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0156.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0156","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0156.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0156.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/49d534031f059b5baeabd1b01333339621c7c95a/2001/CVE-2001-0156.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0156.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0156.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0156.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0156.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0642.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0641","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0641.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0155","title":"VShell SSH 网关格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"VShell SSH 网关 1.0.1 及更早版本存在格式化字符串漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在登录时发送包含格式化字符串说明符（如 %n、%s 等）的用户名触发该漏洞，进而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 VShell SSH 网关 1.0.1 及更早版本，攻击者无需事先获取账户凭据，只需能够连接到目标的 SSH 服务即可利用。Vandyke 公司已发布安全公告并建议用户升级至修复版本以消除该风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0155"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 VShell SSH gateway 至 1.0.2 或更高版本，该补丁修复了用户名字段对格式字符串说明符的过滤逻辑。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙或访问控制列表中限制 SSH 服务的来源 IP，仅允许可信网段访问，并在日志中监控包含 %s、%n、%x 等格式字符的异常登录请求。临时缓解措施可将 VShell 配置文件中的用户名验证模式设为仅接受字母数字字符，禁止特殊符号传入日志记录函数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a021601-1.txt","http://www.vandyke.com/products/vshell/security102.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0155.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0155.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0155","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0155.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0155.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0155.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5d343bea8cfc0d9952499ddc0950571762ca42cd/2001/CVE-2001-0155.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0155.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0155.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0155.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0641.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0639","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0639.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0146","title":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 和 Exchange 2000 URL 内存拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 和 Exchange 2000 在处理特制 URL 时存在内存分配缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过反复发送一系列精心构造的 URL 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务器内存耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 IIS 5.0 及 Exchange 2000 等版本，攻击者只需能够向目标服务器发送 HTTP 请求即可利用，攻击复杂度低，但仅影响系统可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0146"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:45Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-026 对应补丁（Q300466），或升级 IIS 5.0 至 Service Pack 2 以上版本。对于已停止支持的 Windows 2000/Exchange 2000 系统，建议迁移至受支持的 Windows Server 版本并部署最新安全更新；同时可在 IIS 中启用 URLScan 工具过滤畸形请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/796584","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2440","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2441","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-014","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6171","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6172","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0146.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0146","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0146.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0146.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0146.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f15ca12380fc765fd5195387509666c3b113208/2001/CVE-2001-0146.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0146.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0146.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0146.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2001-0146.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0639.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0569","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0569.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0001","title":"PHP-Nuke cookie解码 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"PHP-Nuke 4.4 的 cookiedecode 函数在处理用户认证 cookie 时未对解码后的数据进行严格校验，攻击者可通过提取 cookie 中的认证信息并篡改重放，绕过身份认证机制获得其他用户账户的访问权限。该漏洞影响使用 PHP-Nuke 4.4 版本的网站系统，无需身份认证即可在远程发起攻击，成功利用后可窃取或冒充其他用户身份执行操作，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0001"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:27Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 PHP-Nuke 至 5.0 及以上版本（已修复 cookiedecode 认证绕过漏洞），或迁移至 WordPress/Drupal 等维护中的 CMS。若暂无法升级，请在应用层实施 Cookie 安全加固：设置 HttpOnly、Secure 标志，启用 SameSite=Strict，并对用户输入的 Cookie 数据进行严格验证和签名校验，防止认证信息被篡改窃取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0257.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6183","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dfd3785ea0ca532d9efd1c0b17520a18e47b035b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0001.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0001.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0001","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0001.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0001.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0001.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c229a4a30cc18f066e828fa99f8fa314a2da50ed/2001/CVE-2001-0001.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0001.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0001.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0001.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0569.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0569.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0247","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0247.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0309","title":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 inetd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 的 inetd 超级服务守护进程未能正确关闭其内部服务（如 chargen、daytime、echo 等）的套接字连接。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发起大量并发连接请求，消耗系统文件描述符资源，导致 inetd 服务无法响应新的连接请求，最终引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2 及使用相同 inetd 实现的 Linux 发行版，攻击条件简单，无需身份认证即可远程触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0309"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:04Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Red Hat Linux 6.2 补丁版本或更高版本。如无法升级，编辑 /etc/inetd.conf，注释（行首加 #）chargen、daytime、echo、discard 等内部服务行，然后重启 inetd 服务（kill -HUP <inetd_pid> 或 /etc/init.d/inetd restart）；也可迁移至 xinetd 替代传统 inetd 以缓解此问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-006.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6380","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0309.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0309","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0309.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0309.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8x55-jj29-5rqp/GHSA-8x55-jj29-5rqp.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/rh_inetd.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0309.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--240a59d4-047e-435a-afbc-f33126bf535f.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0247.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0143","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0143.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0322","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer / Outlook MSHTML.dll 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MSHTML.DLL 是 Internet Explorer 内核中的 HTML 解析器组件，在处理浏览器窗口对象关联的脚本时存在缺陷。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网页，利用脚本反复创建和删除与浏览器窗口对象关联的 COM 对象，触发 MSHTML.DLL 解析异常，导致浏览器或 Outlook 应用程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4.0 及更早版本以及 Outlook 2000/5.5，攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意页面或邮件，利用条件较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0322"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:05Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Internet Explorer 4.0 及 Outlook 2000/5.5，微软已不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级到 Internet Explorer 11 及以上版本，并将 Outlook 升级到 Office 2016 或更高版本。如无法升级，可禁用 Internet Explorer 中的 Active Scripting 功能（Internet 选项 → 安全 → 自定义级别 → 禁用脚本），或改用 Microsoft Edge / Chrome 等现代浏览器。对于 Outlook，建议禁用 HTML 邮件预览功能或改用纯文本格式阅读邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97958685100219&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2202","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5938","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20552","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/